---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Examples
description: A coherent, cross-linked fixture set for a single example city.
---
<div class="container py-5">
  <h1 class="mb-3">Examples</h1>
  <p class="lead">One coherent fixture set, not a pile of disconnected snippets. Every reference below resolves to an entity in the same set — that is what <code>tools/validate.py</code> checks.</p>

  <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
    <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="border rounded p-3 text-center">
      <div class="h3 mb-0">{{ examples.files | length }}</div><div class="small text-body-secondary">files</div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="border rounded p-3 text-center">
      <div class="h3 mb-0">{{ examples.entities | length }}</div><div class="small text-body-secondary">entities</div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="border rounded p-3 text-center">
      <div class="h3 mb-0">{{ examples.refCount }}</div><div class="small text-body-secondary">cross-references</div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="border rounded p-3 text-center">
      <div class="h3 mb-0">0</div><div class="small text-body-secondary">dangling</div>
    </div></div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="h4 mb-3">Entities</h2>
  <div class="table-responsive mb-5">
    <table class="table table-sm align-middle">
      <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Identifier</th><th>File</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for e in examples.entities %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ e.name or "—" }}</td>
          <td><code>{{ e.type }}</code></td>
          <td class="small gs-mono text-body-secondary gs-ns">{{ e.id }}</td>
          <td class="small">{{ e.file }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="h4 mb-3">Source</h2>
  <div class="accordion" id="exampleFiles">
    {% for f in examples.files %}
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <h3 class="accordion-header">
        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#file-{{ loop.index }}" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="file-{{ loop.index }}">
          <code>{{ f.name }}</code><span class="ms-2 text-body-secondary small">{{ f.count }} entities</span>
        </button>
      </h3>
      <div id="file-{{ loop.index }}" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#exampleFiles">
        <div class="accordion-body p-0">
          <pre class="mb-0 p-3"><code class="language-json">{{ f.raw }}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
